body = "DIGITAL LOGIC LAB REPORT: due Friday 9:00 am.\n\nTo do: ch. 4 timing diagrams, conclusion, references.\n\nCanteen closes 10:30 but the guard never kicks anyone out of CDS.\n\nDO NOT FALL ASLEEP."
